# Normalize line endings for this repository.
#
# Git stores every text file with LF in the object database and checks it out
# with CRLF in the working tree. That keeps diffs clean no matter which editor
# or tool wrote the file, while giving the Windows Overseer host and Windows
# development machines the CRLF they expect.
* text=auto eol=crlf

# Files consumed by Linux tooling must stay LF in the working tree too.
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
